<div class="volunteer-start"><h1>Open your volunteer session</h1><p>Your private link transfers scoped session permission to this anonymous browser.</p><form method="post" class="form-panel" action="/volunteer/<?=e($sessionId)?>/open" data-volunteer-exchange><?=csrf()?><label for="session-secret">Private link fragment</label><input id="session-secret" name="session_secret" type="password" minlength="64" maxlength="64" autocomplete="off" required><div class="actions primary-actions"><button>Open private session</button></div></form><noscript><p>Paste only the secret after # from your private link. The explicit action keeps it out of request URLs. Remove the fragment from browser history yourself; automatic history removal needs JavaScript.</p></noscript></div>
